WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.871
Today has two small jobs. Six little words, and the ten words from yesterday.

2
00:00:05.321 --> 00:00:12.133
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:12.633 --> 00:00:15.213
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:15.713 --> 00:00:20.609
The six little words are in almost every sentence. They do not sound out the usual way.

5
00:00:21.059 --> 00:00:25.666
Point to each little word on the page, and say it. Your child says it after you.

6
00:00:26.116 --> 00:00:30.622
Do not ask your child to sound these out. Just tell them. They are words to know.

7
00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:35.951
Then your child reads the six alone. Tell them any word they do not know, and move on.

8
00:00:36.401 --> 00:00:41.486
Job two is the same ten words as yesterday, in a new order. There are three rounds.

9
00:00:41.936 --> 00:00:46.306
Each round, the words come a little easier. That is what your child should notice.

10
00:00:46.756 --> 00:00:53.060
There is no timer. Do not ask for faster. Ask for one more round, and say: hear how easy that was?

11
00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:59.419
Your child marks a box after each round. At the end, they say three words to you all at once.
